      "en": "The children of Israel again did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight; and the LORD delivered them into the hand of the Philistines forty years.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손이 다시 여호와의 목전에 악을 행하였으므로 여호와께서 그들을 사십년 동안 블레셋 사람의 손에 붙이시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ad5c9cbf234756c77317248fba982f1ba1981bba3237efea80cd8ce1f20c772a",
      "translation_text_hash": "b15d7212af56befb3aa76e63d121cbee25cd0172fb2f011987a7f632dcefc84d",
