      ],
      "en": "There was a certain man of Zorah, of the family of the Danites, whose name was Manoah; and his wife was barren, and childless.",
      "ko": "소라 땅에 단 지파의 가족중 마노아라 이름하는 자가 있더라 그 아내가 잉태하지 못하므로 생산치 못하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "d0751e63da86604e3e947130356a0b7c0977919876e1b8e15edc81ac7b1a11d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "8169b3ed763546008e79288594df6c8cd74124c42bf13d5bc9d3aa84cc47cf92",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
