      "en": "Manoah said to his wife, “We shall surely die, because we have seen God.”",
      "ko": "그 아내에게 이르되 우리가 하나님을 보았으니 반드시 죽으리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "53e0ea045dd819db2c7dc1ea39b35cbe3e98fbaff50ac782bae216dcac2c0be1",
      "translation_text_hash": "30635a05ac4caacc398323c6ba08654f32899c0e03b64483e309dc27a9546cf5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
