      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 23
        }
      ],
      "en": "But his wife said to him, “If the LORD were pleased to kill us, he wouldn’t have received a burnt offering and a meal offering at our hand, and he wouldn’t have shown us all these things, nor would he have told us such things as these at this time.”",
      "ko": "그 아내가 그에게 이르되 여호와께서 우리를 죽이려 하셨더면 우리 손에서 번제와 소제를 받지 아니하셨을 것이요 이 모든 일을 보이지 아니하셨을 것이며 이제 이런 말씀도 우리에게 이르지 아니하셨으리이다 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "69e9c603e7bf7755027f85829dc2fcbb9a03bd5063a66b629bbaa0df42a9c008",
      "translation_text_hash": "a0bbc696271d89114b1175ce0712f69743ee600bf405bab30ff9a158611fb3c5",
